  [[End] ℓ], [The holder becomes `⊥` (X1; X7, declared `&T` holding `⊥`). The content replaces ℓ's loan or fills its holes; the loans it holds move with it, their contexts composed with ℓ's site's, and a composition of injective maps is injective (X5); a path $n -> ell -> m$ of nesting becomes $n -> m$ (X3).], [#a-full],
